      "properties": {
        "reported": true,
        "property_type": "magnetic",
        "summary": "χMT at 300 K is 62.60 cm3 K mol−1 (expected 67.48), falling to 29.10 cm3 K mol−1 at 2 K. Magnetization at 2 K reaches 20.8 μB at 5 T without saturation. Frequency-dependent out-of-phase ac maxima below 4.5 K under zero dc field indicate SMM behavior. Cole–Cole fits give 0.1 < α < 0.41 (1.9–3.7 K). Relaxation fitted with Raman + Orbach processes yields Ueff/kB = 10.38 K and τ0 = 9.8 × 10−6 s. Applied dc fields of 100–2000 Oe at 2.5 K change χ″ maxima only slightly.",
        "measurements": [
          {
