        "summary": "χMT at 300 K is 51.10 cm3 K mol−1 (expected 56.70), falling to 34.70 cm3 K mol−1 at 2 K. Magnetization at 2 K reaches 18.6 μB at 5 T without saturation. Temperature- and frequency-dependent χ′ and χ″ under zero dc field indicate slow magnetization relaxation below ca. 6 K, but no χ″ maximum is observed down to 2 K, consistent with fast quantum tunneling. Variable-frequency ac data under 3000 Oe still lack full peaks to 1.9 K.",
